-> Aggregate: count(distinct `<temporary>`.`COUNT(DISTINCT c1)`)  (cost=0.8 rows=1) (actual rows loops)
    -> Gather: 4 workers, parallel scan on t1  (cost=0.4 rows=4) (actual rows loops)
        -> Aggregate: count(distinct `<temporary>`.`COUNT(DISTINCT c1)`)  (cost=0.4 rows=1) (actual rows loops)
            -> Parallel table scan on t1  (cost=0.325 rows=0.75) (actual rows loops)

